Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.60,PriPara,Mireri,0,0,0,,A pop and a step and I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.75,PriPara,Mireri,0,0,0,,Let's put on another flashy performance today!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.47,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Meganii?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.13,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,A patrolling Meganii?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.67,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Should you really be playing around, Meganii?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.67,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'm not playing around.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.73,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,It looks like you are to me-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.23,0:00:30.82,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time, I stole your heart.{consistency with 57}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.69,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Autumn is just around the corner.{consistency with  57}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.01,0:00:37.21,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Genius said he'd be back this autumn!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.21,0:00:40.82,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Get out there and catch him so I don't\N have to worry about winning!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.97,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I've already come up with a way to deal with him.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.62,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,That's why I'm patrolling like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.52,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And on top of that, I've put in a request\N to the Parajuku PriPara Police...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.21,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,...to dispatch the PriPara Police!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.59,0:00:55.17,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.24,0:02:29.17,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ham and Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.89,0:02:32.52,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.69,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Our police force is top-notch,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.58,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.36,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And with that, I'll return to patrolling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.83,0:02:43.72,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,The PriPara Police, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.01,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of people will show up?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.41,0:02:52.83,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Candy À La Mode has a new brand for the artist who loves painting pictures.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.83,0:02:57.00,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The cute poppin' Candy À La Mode More fits her perfectly!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.75,0:03:00.46,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara Change complete!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.98,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.26,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.35,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sh-She sure looked like a cute idol...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.14,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,A blooming of color.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.14,0:03:14.56,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,It was a very colorful coord.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.93,0:03:17.78,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,I've never seen her before-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.78,0:03:20.27,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Could she be part of the PriPara Police?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.55,0:03:22.88,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.76,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's got to be!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.38,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Within minutes of Meganii calling the police,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,a new idol appeared.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There's no refuting my reasoning.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.40,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,You could be right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.33,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,So she's with the police-pri...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.73,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,You're dazzling-picasso!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.73,0:03:45.42,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's play-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.93,0:03:47.58,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,There's no way-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.29,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What the heck did she say?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.30,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Play?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.10,0:03:51.89,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.58,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Yehello!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.58,0:03:55.66,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm Kiki Ajimi!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.66,0:03:58.10,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Today is my PriPara début-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.96,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,N-Nice to capisce ya.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.96,0:04:01.92,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Hey now!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.95,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Laala's face isn't your sketchbook-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.95,0:04:06.07,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.99,PriPara,Miron,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.92,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Everything shiny-shiny, frilly-frilly, sparkly-sparkly...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.63,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,and cute-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.16,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Autumn of art.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.16,0:04:28.93,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{\an8}So Munch Klimt creativity flowing-DaVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.87,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like she's listening.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.87,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's sure going about at her own pace.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.93,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, don't graffiti on the walls-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.89,0:04:33.43,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Heart jumping dancing-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.42,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Sh-She's using a sentence-ender, so I guess that makes her a sentence-ender idol-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.70,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,She has too many enders.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.20,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I haven't a clue what she's saying.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.47,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's crazier than Mirei's pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.47,0:04:48.27,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,It seems she's using artist's names-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.66,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Picasso, Da Vinci...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.17,0:04:53.62,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Since she paints pictures, her sentence ender is "da Vinci"?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.43,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Who the Vinci is Da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.15,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's not who-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.27,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Da Vinci as in the Leonardo from the village Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.27,0:05:03.59,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,What I mean is, Leonardo da Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.67,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,To put it simply, a noteworthy historical artist-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.67,0:05:11.12,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh? I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.41,0:05:15.39,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.39,0:05:17.57,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.89,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Michelange-look!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.88,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Venus de Milo!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.86,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Complete-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.57,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.48,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.94,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She brought out my cute side!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.69,0:05:31.00,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Creatively original.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.95,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Thunderous applause.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.91,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sunflower!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.37,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,I can feel the Winds of Andalucia-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.03,0:05:43.16,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing to have you praise me deske-like that!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.16,0:05:44.96,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,My happiness has really deskel-ated!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.01,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Ajimi!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.01,0:05:49.74,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's still hard to understand you, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.52,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,They're pretty good-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.52,0:05:53.93,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,You could use them for wanted posters-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.54,0:05:55.66,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.66,0:05:59.38,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ajimi, you're with the police, aren't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.38,0:06:01.14,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You don't need to hide it from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.74,0:06:05.70,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You decided to not dress like a policewoman\N so the perp wouldn't catch on, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.03,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh! That makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.03,0:06:08.36,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Come on, girls...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.99,0:06:14.41,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.58,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Oh my, how terrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.66,0:06:26.29,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This is where the clue was found?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.95,0:06:30.76,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,An eerie picture drawn on the ground...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.35,0:06:32.57,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This is the seventh.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.42,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, Meganii!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.97,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.68,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Practical jokes are bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.68,PriPara2,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Be a good kid and don't imitate this.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.68,0:06:42.29,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Lina, make it nice and clean.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.03,0:06:46.40,PriPara,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Lina!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.46,0:06:51.49,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,There have been other jokes like this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.38,0:06:53.19,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Infuriating!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.19,0:06:55.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Graffiti is ba-dechin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.11,0:06:57.53,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So says someone who just drew on a wall-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.53,0:06:58.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Bad-house of Medici!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Bad-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.18,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Listen when people talk-pri!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.29,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Bad-completely.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.29,0:07:03.77,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Plum-delicious.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.77,0:07:07.38,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's possible that this is also\N the work of Phantom Thief Genius.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.38,0:07:07.92,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.98,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.98,0:07:12.82,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well, it's just my intuition.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.82,0:07:16.72,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Don't you think Phantom Thief Genius\N is the only person who would do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.27,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,But why are they doing it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.27,0:07:22.27,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well, if we're able to catch them,\Nwe might be able to figure that out.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.27,0:07:24.38,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Let's leave this to the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.98,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now then, I must be off.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.31,0:07:30.37,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.07,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's go catch him!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.07,0:07:32.90,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.90,0:07:35.45,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Whether it was Phantom Thief Genius or not,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.61,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,what's important is catching the culprit.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.61,0:07:38.50,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Right, Ajimi?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.03,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Important! Noble! Nobleman! Great man!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.03,0:07:43.64,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,A great man is an admirable man-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.46,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,To keep peace in PriPara!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.96,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's set out!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.96,0:07:50.42,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.70,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's Gauguin!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.70,0:07:55.18,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go-ing My Way!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.04,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's Gogh!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.93,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let it Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.59,0:07:59.93,PriPara2,Lala,0,0,0,,They're competing...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.89,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.89,0:08:10.06,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero Derosaimu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.74,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Meat buns are delicious!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.82,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,This autumn appetite!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.82,0:08:16.24,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A suspicious individual has suddenly been found!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.28,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Apprehend her!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.50,0:08:19.07,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.28,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,What hast thou done?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.82,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,I was just drawing my magic circle!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.82,0:08:27.54,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is the autumn of summoning nefarious creatures!{a demon from the depths of hell!}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.00,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aroma may be impish{a demon}, but she's not bad!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.29,0:08:34.23,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you want to arrest Aroma, \Nyou'll need to give Mikan three pizza buns!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.23,0:08:35.13,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.51,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Is three pizza buns all I'm worth to thee?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.72,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Just trying it out! Just trying it out!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.02,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Another suspicious individual spotted!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.93,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Arrest her!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.59,PriPara,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko was just drawing a sumo arena-chanko!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.40,PriPara,Chanko,0,0,0,,It's the autumn of sports-chanko!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.70,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Come on, Ajimi, pull it together.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.70,0:08:56.36,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Every single one of them have been innocent!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.80,0:09:00.21,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Will you really be able to catch the phantom thief like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.68,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Nyaha huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.68,0:09:06.04,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,But why, oh why would Ajimi be trying\N to catch the phantom thief-da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.53,0:09:09.16,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Why would you?\NYou're with the police, aren't you, Ajimi?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.08,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Porisu?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.19,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Poorisu?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.19,0:09:17.51,PriPara2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Porokku?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.51,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,It looks like she's trying to figure something out.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.00,0:09:23.46,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,But this seems to be the first time she's reacted to anything we've said.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.18,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Finally-pri?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.35,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi is not a member of the police-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.35,0:09:30.65,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't lie!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.65,0:09:33.15,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi is not so rousseau as to lie-DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.15,0:09:35.21,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're really not?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.27,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.11,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,So you're not undercover...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm uccello-ing you I'm not!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.68,0:09:41.32,PriPara,I'm not-uccello!{https,0,0,0,,I'm not the police-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.53,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,See? I told you so-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.49,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.45,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.66,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.62,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.58,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,You're not?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.41,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,So you're not with the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.41,0:10:09.43,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Then I wonder who is with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.64,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Nyaha-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.10,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.84,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Henri-henri?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.84,0:10:18.32,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hold Henri a Matisse-Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.65,0:10:19.56,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.10,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're not with the police, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.28,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Then it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.99,0:10:28.04,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,It'll be impossible for us to catch this mischievous perpetrator in addition to the phantom thief-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.04,0:10:31.94,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It is still too early to give up-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.66,0:10:33.54,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.75,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Let's go go go to Christina's World-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.67,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.43,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,This is the crime scene from earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.64,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,They sure did clean it up-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.45,0:10:49.20,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is it-da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.37,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.37,0:10:52.58,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Observing, observing!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.02,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What's important is observing-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.77,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Observing...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.77,0:11:01.23,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Meganii and Headmistress Ookanda \Nalready cleaned up the area.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.23,0:11:02.53,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's pointless. Pointless I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.22,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Make like the statue of David and stay put.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.28,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,There's more here-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.28,0:11:06.78,PriPara,Doron,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.78,0:11:07.49,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.99,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Here-da Vinci! DaVinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.41,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.59,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.51,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What if it was poisoned?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.98,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I was half choking-da Vinci.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.92,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,But! But-claudeMonet!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.55,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It all makes sense-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.55,0:11:29.94,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.81,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.93,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,...a sunflower seed-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.93,0:11:36.77,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,A sunflower seed?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.07,0:11:40.68,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What? So you're saying that the culprit is a hamster?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.37,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Isn't that a bit ridiculous?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.37,0:11:42.99,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.77,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.66,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.87,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Uh...?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.32,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Oh my?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.71,0:12:06.87,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,{My oh my oh my oh my!}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.18,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Leonardo da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.18,0:12:16.34,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Da-Da-Da Vinci! Da-Da-Da-Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.87,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I saw it-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.18,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Thank you, da Vinci-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.78,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.41,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.37,0:12:31.83,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Ajimi!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.44,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.07,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.07,0:12:41.84,PriPara,Larothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.89,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.30,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A hamster?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.59,0:12:49.04,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Better yet, this!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.10,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.10,0:12:53.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're the sunflower seed shells-raphael.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.88,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Sunflower seeds, you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.73,PriPara,Mion,0,0,0,,I get it! Sunflower seeds!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.25,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.54,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This hamster! This hamster!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,He! He is the Kokoschka Kandinsky culprit-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.69,0:13:07.90,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.86,0:13:12.07,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Well done, Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.18,0:13:17.22,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Indeed. Those eerie pictures on the ground\N were created by him.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.22,0:13:18.29,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.60,0:13:20.14,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.14,0:13:25.46,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You solved the case that was as hard \Nto see through as opaque watercolour.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.46,0:13:26.74,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.26,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Ajimi done Raphael did it-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.26,0:13:30.24,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.24,0:13:31.58,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.97,PriPara,Mirei,0,0,0,,Explain it properly-pri.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.68,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.64,0:13:42.11,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the inspector that the PriPara Police dispatched upon my request.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.11,0:13:42.90,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.90,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Inspector?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.63,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Him?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.63,0:13:46.75,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.86,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,He's on the lookout for Phantom Thief Genius,\N and has been staking out the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.76,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Which is when...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.83,0:14:01.04,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,That means those eerie pictures...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.36,0:14:02.38,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.89,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The sunflower seed shells just\Nhappened to get scattered like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.89,0:14:06.94,PriPara,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.94,0:14:07.91,PriPara,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.00,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Will an inspector like him be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.76,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.18,0:14:15.07,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Besides, I've also been patrolling.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.07,0:14:18.29,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Sir Ham also has other large issues he's responsible for.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.98,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,As such, I thought I should find him a partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.41,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,A partner?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.41,0:14:28.01,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,If someone was able to figure out that\NSir Ham created those eerie pictures,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.01,0:14:31.82,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,their insight and observation skills would be of great use to the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.90,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What do you mean-da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.90,0:14:35.53,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.49,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's a police badge.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.98,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I can have it-da Vinci?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.98,0:14:45.06,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You've been recognized as his partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.74,0:14:52.87,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please catch the phantom thief as\N part of the Parajuku PriPara Police.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.87,0:14:58.62,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,PriPara is a free place where power and money don't hold sway.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.10,PriPara,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,We must not succumb to anyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.58,PriPara,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Okay! Okay!
